<title>GERMANY: Ruetgers expects 1996 profit at 150 mln dmk.</title>
<headline>Ruetgers expects 1996 profit at 150 mln dmk.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemicals group Ruetgers AG said on Tuesday that it had achieved sales of five billion marks ($3 billion) in 1996 and expected pre-tax profit for the year to be about 150 million marks.</p>
<p>Ruetgers, recovering from losses in 1995, had also said in November that it expected a group pre-tax profit of about 150 million marks, including a one-off gain of 40 million marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525 ($ = 1.640 German Marks)</p>
</text>
